# Copy this file to .env and fill in real values.
# .env is git-ignored — it should NEVER be committed or sent to the frontend.
# Each real property gets its own pmsId/hotelId/apiKey trio below. The mock
# properties (if re-enabled) use placeholder values since they aren't real
# hotels.

